/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386048 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "0f36e193-cfb7-556d-862d-7ca0f147ebca" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386048 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+3y=0 \\\\ 2y=1.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{1\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 3}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386050 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386051 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386052 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386053 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386054 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186386053 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386049 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a482c228-62c7-528d-a980-052fac0d225f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186386050 #edb/ref 1080 "x=\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592